  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "when I toggle gestures on I expected to lose hand tracking and have just the normal gestures, and honestly, id rather bc some gestures are holding items and such and it looks odd when I got a handgun and I'm holding an object... and it basically impossible to do a peace sign now.  \n\nalso, I feel so pressured to keep my hands clenched bc open hand is an action. I think I'm gonna bind my gestures to the touchpad, for now, like on the vive wand, it was pretty easy especially now since it isn't how I move. \n\nI hope this is taken into considerations, Thanks! - MikeCore",
